# Nix files
# Unanchored on purpose: nix build drops a result symlink wherever it is run, and that
# happens all over the tree (src/Kernel/xnu/result and so on). The cost is that a real
# file named "result" is ignored too; use git add -f if you ever need one. A rule that
# excludes only Nix store symlinks would be better, but gitignore cannot express it.
*result
*result-*
*/output.txt
output.txt
.puredarwin-*